<title>BELGIUM: Innogenetics, Irish co in DNA probe deal.</title>
<headline>Innogenetics, Irish co in DNA probe deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bioscience company Innogenetics NV said on Tuesday it had signed a patent pooling agreement with Irish life sciences company BioResearch Ireland.</p>
<p>&quot;The pooling of patent rights to Bacterial Spacer Probe Technology by means of a collaborative agreement has markedly strengthened the positions of BioResearch and Innogenetics in the area of bacterial diagnostics,&quot; Innogenetics said.</p>
<p>The two companies will use the technology by licensing specific DNA-based probes to third parties, it said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
